WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.741
LOOK. Compare a clear sample and cloudy sample without tasting.

00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:07.603
ZOOM. Show germs too small to be seen by the eye.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.475
TREAT. Show a trusted adult making water safer.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:15.497
STORE. Keep treated water in a clean covered vessel.
